"<h2>Configuring Automated Backups</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Open your App or Database in the dashboard.</li>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Backups</strong> tab.</li>\n<li>Choose your <strong>Storage Destination</strong>.</li>\n<li>Set your backup frequency using standard cron syntax (e.g. <code>0 2 * * *</code> for daily at 2:00 AM).</li>\n<li>Specify <strong>Retention Count</strong> (e.g. keep the last 7 daily backups).</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Backup Catch-Up (BACKUP_CATCH_UP)</h2>\n<p>If your server was offline or rebooting when a scheduled backup was supposed to run, SaaSBase detects the missed schedule and runs a single catch-up backup immediately upon startup.</p>"